WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.499
- I feel like there's a tongue

00:00:01.499 --> 00:00:03.415
draped over my hand right now.

00:00:03.415 --> 00:00:05.406
(upbeat music)

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:09.313
- I've never tried uni before.

00:00:09.313 --> 00:00:10.798
- I love sushi, I've never had that.

00:00:10.798 --> 00:00:12.737
- My only experience with sea urchins is

00:00:12.737 --> 00:00:14.839
Finding Nemo and Freddi the fish.

00:00:14.839 --> 00:00:17.288
- My dad loves sushi, and he says that

00:00:17.288 --> 00:00:19.818
sea urchin is the worst
thing he's ever eaten.

00:00:19.818 --> 00:00:24.775
(upbeat music)

00:00:28.175 --> 00:00:29.861
- It's not what I imagined.

00:00:29.861 --> 00:00:32.101
- Oh, oh!

00:00:32.101 --> 00:00:33.606
- It looks like a tongue.

00:00:33.606 --> 00:00:34.984
- It looks like a brain.

00:00:34.984 --> 00:00:35.851
- It feels like a slug.

00:00:35.851 --> 00:00:37.128
- It's just like, dripping.

00:00:37.128 --> 00:00:39.667
- Okay, always wanted to
try it, I'm gonna do it.

00:00:42.711 --> 00:00:44.511
- Some sand in there.

00:00:48.041 --> 00:00:50.338
- It's actually not that bad (laughs)

00:00:50.338 --> 00:00:51.569
- What was that?

00:00:51.569 --> 00:00:52.521
- What's the big deal about it?

00:00:52.521 --> 00:00:53.554
It was fine.

00:00:53.554 --> 00:00:54.750
- It tastes like a combination between

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:55.935
the ocean and shoe leather.

00:00:55.935 --> 00:01:00.612
- That intense sea taste
made my stomach turn.

00:01:00.612 --> 00:01:03.062
- I can feel it going down my esophagus.

00:01:03.062 --> 00:01:06.475
- The texture was like if a
toddler sh(bleep) himself.

00:01:06.475 --> 00:01:09.899
- I think it has that kind
of muddy texture to it,

00:01:09.899 --> 00:01:12.153
but the flavor is very mild.

00:01:12.153 --> 00:01:14.195
- I'm very cheap, so I don't
know if I would pay for this,

00:01:14.195 --> 00:01:16.331
but it's good enough to eat
if someone bought it for me.

00:01:16.331 --> 00:01:18.491
- Once you get past the diarrhea color

00:01:18.491 --> 00:01:21.196
and tongue texture, it's not bad at all.

00:01:21.196 --> 00:01:23.246
(upbeat music)

00:01:26.198 --> 00:01:27.613
- I always eat animals and then

00:01:27.613 --> 00:01:29.494
I feel sorry for them afterwards.

00:01:29.494 --> 00:01:30.979
I don't know why.

00:01:30.979 --> 00:01:33.089
This always happens to me.

